5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We need data, not guesses. Who is actually driving this car?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. Let’s look at the mechanics of our friction, not just the miles.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The car’s state at handover is critical. I need to know if it’s ready.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I want the real figures. Guesswork is for amateurs, not us.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check the hours recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Daisuke, the diary is a start, but it lacks context.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Context is key. I’ll look into what other households did.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I’m checking the mechanic’s remarks. Wear patterns tell the truth.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I’ll pull the fuel receipts. That’s where the money goes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll also look at the state of the car at handover.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Shion, fuel receipts are good, but they don’t show frequency.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Frequency is part of the pattern. I’ll check the weekly trips.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Weekly trips are predictable. I need to know about the heavy use weeks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,Heavy use is just a spike. I need the baseline.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about the untangling afterwards. I’ll check the tax papers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,Tax papers are boring but necessary. I’ll check the insurance too.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Insurance is a fixed cost. I’ll look at the trial of recording runs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,A trial is a test. I’ll check the hours of use in the diary.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I’ll also look at the last year’s tax, insurance and parking papers.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the last year’s fuel receipts to see the actual spend.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
