33,2,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The paperwork is clear. The trial, however, is a time sink.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,I found that asking favours sours groups. We must avoid that trap.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The mechanic says short runs kill the car. That explains the wear.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The receipts show two of us bought most fuel. The tax is 280k.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The car came back dirty twice. The fuel split is very uneven.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"Shion, the 280k is fixed. The fuel is variable.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Daisuke, the dirt is a symptom. The favour-asking is the disease.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"The short runs are the problem. We need longer, planned trips.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"If two of us pay for fuel, the others are free-riding.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to know who owes what without the argument.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need a system that accounts for the time cost of tracking.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A system that requires constant checking will fail. It breeds resentment.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we plan longer trips, the car lasts longer. It’s logical.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"Logic says we split the fixed costs equally, but fuel by use.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with Shion. But the tracking time is the real burden.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,The tracking time is a hidden subsidy. We must price it in.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. If we don't, the checker becomes the victim.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I can handle the planning. It’s efficient. I don’t mind the work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,I’ll handle the numbers. I don’t mind the work either.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I can do the handover checks. It’s quiet work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
