60,3,1,talk,Minako,,Option A is rigid. It ignores actual need and creates waste.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option C centralizes power. It risks the favour-asking dynamic I found.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option B is the only one that accounts for the mechanic’s warning.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option B is logical. It ties cost to use. No free-riding.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option B seems fair, but the booking process might be tiring.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"Daisuke, the tiring part is the tracking. We can automate that.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,Automation reduces the social cost. It removes the personal ask.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I will manage the calendar. It ensures the car is ready for use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,I will audit the distances. The numbers must be accurate.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the car’s state before and after each booking.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,This division of labor is clear. It addresses the hidden subsidies.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It prevents the resentment I saw in other groups. It is sustainable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"It ensures the car is used efficiently. No more short, wasteful runs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,It ensures the money is accounted for. No more guesswork.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,It gives me a quiet role. I can handle the checks without stress.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minako,,I am confident in this structure. It is fair and transparent.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. It protects the group dynamic. Let’s proceed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready to start the calendar immediately. It is the right choice.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shion,,I will set up the spreadsheet for the audit. It is inevitable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will prepare the checklist for the handover checks. It feels right.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
